  "reference": "Proverbs 25",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "25",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.25.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.25.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "also proverbs of Solomon, which the men of Hezekiah king of Judah copied out.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "It is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.25.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.25.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the glory of God to conceal a thing: but the honour of kings",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.25.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.25.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to search out a matter.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The heaven for height, and the earth for depth, and the heart of kings",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.25.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.25.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unsearchable.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Take away the dross from the silver, and there shall come forth a vessel for the finer.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Take away the wicked",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "from",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.25.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.25.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "before the king, and his throne shall be established in righteousness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Put not forth thyself in the presence of the king, and stand not in the place of great",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "men:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.25.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.25.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For better",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.25.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.25.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that it be said unto thee, Come up hither; than that thou shouldest be put lower in the presence of the prince whom thine eyes have seen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go not forth hastily to strive, lest",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thou know not",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.25.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.25.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "what to do in the end thereof, when thy neighbour hath put thee to shame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Debate thy cause with thy neighbour",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "himself;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.25.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.25.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and discover not a secret to another:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lest he that heareth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.25.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.25.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "put thee to shame, and thine infamy turn not away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A word fitly spoken",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is like",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.25.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.25.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "apples of gold in pictures of silver.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "As",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.25.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.25.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an earring of gold, and an ornament of fine gold,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "so is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.25.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.25.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a wise reprover upon an obedient ear.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As the cold of snow in the time of harvest,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "so is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.25.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.25.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a faithful messenger to them that send him: for he refresheth the soul of his masters.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whoso boasteth himself of a false gift",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is like",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.25.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.25.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "clouds and wind without rain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "By long forbearing is a prince persuaded, and a soft tongue breaketh the bone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hast thou found honey? eat so much as is sufficient for thee, lest thou be filled therewith, and vomit it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Withdraw thy foot from thy neighbour's house; lest he be weary of thee, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "so",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.25.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.25.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hate thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A man that beareth false witness against his neighbour",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.25.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.25.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a maul, and a sword, and a sharp arrow.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Confidence in an unfaithful man in time of trouble",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is like",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.25.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.25.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a broken tooth, and a foot out of joint.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
